<title>TUNISIA: Arab Tunisian Bank 1996 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Arab Tunisian Bank 1996 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arab Tunisian Bank made a 7.37 million dinars net profit in 1996, up from 6.46 million dinars in 1995, results showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The bank had capital of 35 million dinars and its balance sheet showed reserves of 38.14 million dinars as at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>($=1.08 dinar)</p>
</text>
